doc: ExSrcRemCounters (Ctr): the counters of kind Ctr on the object the evaluating source remembers, read live on the battlefield (0 when it is elsewhere): the first live smRem record keyed by the source, which a token minted under TokRememberSrc (RememberSource$ True) keeps for its creator. It is `Remembered$CardCounters.<KIND>` in a token's characteristic-defining P/T (Saproling Burst's token reads the fade counters on the Burst). dirac/zone_tokrem.go.
